<LegalPage title="Medical Disclaimer" lede="Our website is here to teach, not to diagnose. Please read this short note about how to use the health information on our pages.">
  <h2>Not medical advice</h2>
  <p>The articles, service pages and condition pages on this site are for general information only. They are not a diagnosis, and they are not a replacement for a visit with a doctor. Every foot is different, and the right care depends on your health and history.</p>

  <h2>No doctor-patient relationship</h2>
  <p>Reading this site, sending a message, or calling our office to ask a general question does not make you a patient. A doctor-patient relationship begins only after an exam by one of our providers.</p>

  <h2>In an emergency</h2>
  <p>If you think you have a medical emergency, call 911 or go to the nearest emergency room. Do not wait for a reply from us. Get care quickly for signs such as a deep or spreading wound, red streaks, fever with a foot problem, a foot that is cold or blue, or sudden severe pain or swelling.</p>

  <h2>Results vary</h2>
  <p>Treatment results differ from person to person. Patient stories and reviews describe individual experiences and do not promise a result. Every treatment has benefits and risks, which your provider will explain before you decide.</p>

  <h2>Keep our information up to date</h2>
  <p>Medical knowledge changes. We try to keep our pages accurate, but we cannot promise that all content is complete or current.</p>

  <h2>Talk to us</h2>
  <p>To get advice for your own feet, <a href="tel:+14809639000">call 480-963-9000</a> or book an appointment. We are happy to help.</p>
